412 Spring 2025 Project


Initiating the database using pgAdmin4.

1. In pgAdmin, create a new database.
2. Using a query tool, copy and past code in create_tables.sql under Table Modifications
    The copy command when attempting to create the stock and historical_stock tables might not work. So take them out. Manually import them with pgAdmin 4 later.
3. After tables are created.
4. Manually import the stock.csv into stock table
    Make sure that the stock table is manually imported first before stock_prices.csv for the historical_stock
5. Manually import the stock_prices.csv into the historical_stock table.
    When importing, under the COLUMNS of the import options, make sure to get rid of hs_id.  
    

How to run the API server and the Project.

1. cd Server
2. run: nano .env
    Make sure to put your database login information

    PGUSER=your_username
    PGPASSWORD=your_password
    PGHOST=/tmp
    PGPORT=8888
    PGDATABASE=your_database_name

3. run: npm install
    in server directory
4. run: node index.js
    this should run the server
5. now: cd 412-react-stockwatchlist
6. run: npm install
7. run: npm start

